Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how intelligence is made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:26.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new kind of factory, generator of tokens, the building blocks of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:29.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens have opened a new frontier,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,turning data into knowledge, and knowledge into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,They decipher nature's code to reveal hidden cures,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,mirror our cities,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:01:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and tirelessly navigate our world to keep us moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens learn from the way we move,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,deliver the care we need,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,and walk into danger to protect the ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,They see what we cannot,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,so the steadiest hands never work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every idea tokens spark, every success they share,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:02:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,puts what
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,matters within reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens are helping us break new
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,ground on a scale never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:25.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,we can reach for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:40.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sky and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we take the next great leap into
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,a bright new future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,built for all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:03:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:07.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,where it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,all begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA founder and CEO, Jensen Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello, Berlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello, Berlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to GTC.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's great to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before we start,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's give it up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,for our
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,pre-game show hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:03:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Smart and adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Smart and adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,They spoke about AI infrastructure, sovereign AI, AI safety, and physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,They covered enormous amount of ground this morning, and we are going to take it one step further.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really interesting what do L'Oreal, Revolut, Spotify,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Merck, Vodafone, Zara, Porsche, Nestlé, and HSBC have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:39.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, they're all European companies, and they're all working with Nvidia on AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody everybody here is all activated on the AI ecosystem and working towards the AI economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:53.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been working here in Europe now for 33 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:05:04.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You probably don't realize that NV1, Nvidia's first chip, NV2, and NV3, which became Riva 128,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,the chip that saved our company really and launched our company, were all built in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our first partner was SGS Thomson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We manufactured a chip in Crolles, France, assembled it in Malta, and shipped it around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:32.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our first largest customer, the largest customer of GeForce days in the in the in the beginning, was a company called MediaMarkt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:35.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Media MediaMarkt had a spectacular idea about building PCs, as you remember, and they were our largest customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was Elsa, a German company, that brought Nvidia into the workstation industry in the year 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:57.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, Nvidia is in every single workstation all over Europe designing cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:06.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything from styling, design, engineering, simulation all the way through to even inside the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:12.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,which a European company brought us into, Audi, in the year 2005.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:18.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then in year 2020 we started working on autonomous vehicles with Mercedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:26.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you can see Nvidia's life journey, the entire 33 years, I've spent a lot of time in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:31.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm delighted to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm delighted to do GTC here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This year, this last year, we started the new journey to building a new industry here in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The beginnings of the AI economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the last year alone, we've invested nearly 10 billion dollars in Europe across startups,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:58.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,big partnerships, small partnerships all over all over Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:07.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,This last week alone as I journeyed from France and UK to Sweden and now here in Berlin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,we announced the investments of 14 startup companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Overall since the beginning we now have 12,000 plus partnerships across Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're all working towards one goal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,After decades after decades of advancement in the computer industry, we are now at the beginnings of a new industrial revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This image was generated by a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:39.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was prompted by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:46.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nice, simple prompt about AI powering a new industrial revolution generated this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:53.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I gave it a few partners that I wanted to highlight, companies that we're working with, and this is an extraordinary thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:08:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the mind of the AI, this is what it means to build a new industry, generation of tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:10.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,the produce production of intelligence, which integrates into every single industry powering a new industrial revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new industrial revolution happens when the new technology
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,affects how we build something and what we can build.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,How we build something and what we can build.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think in every single way artificial intelligence will affect everything we build and in fact enable us to build new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:46.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this way, because everyone will use it, every company will be powered by it, because it's digital intelligence, the foundation of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single person will use it, every company will be powered by it, every industry will be transformed and new ones will be created.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:09:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this way, like the electricity, it is a new industrial revolution and we're at the very beginnings of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The question is, what is AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to be part of creating this future, understanding what is AI is vitally important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is really a simple framework.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were early to observe that in fact AI is a manufacturing industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:29.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is not just software technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.87,0:09:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is software technology, but not just.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:39.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI of course runs on a computer, but the way that a computer operates is fundamentally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rather than a tool that's used by us, it is now part of a machinery, an infrastructure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,factories that are producing intelligence that are integrated into every single industry and application.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:10:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,A simple model is to think about as think of AI as a five-layer cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Energy powers advanced computers that are part of an AI factory that generates tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,digital intelligence, from the models that run on it, that are integrated into every application.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A five-layer cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be part of this AI economy, you don't want to just be consuming the AI, you want to be producing the AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could do all of that here in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in fact, we've already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Europe is building its AI economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:38.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's five-layer cake represented here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've got great partnerships.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when you look across this five-layer cake, you could recognize that in fact, it is a new industry because there's growth at every single layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:54.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're creating jobs, creating growth at extraordinary rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:11:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Companies here in Europe, Schneider, Siemens Electric, in cred Siemens Energy, in doing incredibly well around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're the computing layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,We integrate into AI factories that are now flourishing all over Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Startup companies like Nebia's doing incredibly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new company called Firebird, which is setting up a new cloud in the Central Asia region.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:25.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And even Cassava in Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:31.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single telco in the future, and I predict this, every single telco in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:38.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,with 100,000 sites representing some 100 gigawatts of distributed telco base stations
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:45.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and data centers will in the future evolve into a distributed AI network.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the AI infrastructure layer is being built out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is then above that, the AI models.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:58.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really important to recognize that long before the AI models emerge, the infrastructure has to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as before you could have an internet, you have to have the networking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as before you could really enjoy the capabilities of electricity, you have to have electrified houses, electrified power plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the models are the next layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:21.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's also interesting to observe that the model layer is not just language models.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It represents language, biology, chemicals, physics, robotic actions, animation, and it represents models of all sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,These different industries are going to be powered by different modalities of AI models,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,which then integrate into the AI natives, the startups, and there are so many here in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the the Europe's AI economy is starting and it's really accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's great to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:58.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the foundation of it, where we contribute, most people think is GPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:12:59.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:06.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We started in 1993 building a graphics chip, which emerged into the GPU, the programmable shading GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:17.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the time over time, we added CUDA acceleration to that, reinvented computing as we know it, which then brought forth artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But NVIDIA today is really a full stack, end-to-end, complete AI factory platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:32.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,The breadth of the technology of our company over the years has really expanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything from GPU computing, Vera Rubin is our latest generation, to the NVLink switches that connect them into one giant GPU,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Vera BlueField 4 compute that we recently introduced, and I'll say a few words about that later, to Spectrum X, which is our Ethernet solution,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,making NVIDIA the largest networking company in the world today, to Grok 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:14:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,a decode accelerator for generation text for token generation, to Vera 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera BlueField 4 storage acceleration, which I'll say a few words in that in just a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then Vera RTX compute, and I'll mention that in just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, this now represents the breadth of technology necessary to create the AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:29.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, nothing works unless you have software that activates it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first part is the system software that runs the AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,These systems are gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:43.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,A 1-gigawatt data center, 1-gigawatt AI factory, costs about $50 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Land, power, shell, all of the compute, networking, storage, power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,cooling, all connected together, multiple acres of AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:15:00.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just turning it on and operating it is a marvel in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:11.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mag- the magnificent amount of software necessary to energize this factory, to put it to use and produce tokens, is an extraordinary feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA offers the entire full-stack software.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,On top of that, are what we call the CUDA X libraries, the algorithms of our company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,What NVIDIA truly is is an algorithm company that designs silicon to accelerate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:30.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, one of them is cuDNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What many researchers recognize as the library that brought forth that started the big bang of modern AI, cuDNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's cuDNN is to AI what SQL is to the world's database industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a domain-specific language, a domain-specific library.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:16:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as OpenGL and DirectX enabled real-time computer graphics, cuDNN enabled the AI computing industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,350 other libraries, those libraries are in fact the crown jewels of our company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:17.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything from computational lithography to signal processing, image processing, data processing, particles, fluids,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:25.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,sparse solvers, incredible breadth of libraries that many of you in the audience have connected into your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how we open new markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how we connect NVIDIA into algorithms that enable you to do computation at incredible speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then finally, on the right-hand side, on that side, the models.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the new software, the new engine of new applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it sits on top of and it collaborates with the CUDA-X libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,These models NVIDIA have been working on across multiple domains.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:03.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,With these models, it opens up new opportunities, and I have lots to say about that later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, every single generation, NVIDIA started with Pascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The AI era started with the Pascal new what is called DGX1 system.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,DGX1 brought to the world the world's first AI supercomputer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:27.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I introduced it 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Delivered the first one to OpenAI.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Started their computation journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:43.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,From Pascal to Volta to Ampere then to many of you who heard about us for the very first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hopper the current generation Blackwell and then now Vera Rubin in full production.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:53.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Notice six generations of architectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:58.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,With each generation we advance the technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the course of that last 10 years, we've improved AI performance by 1 million times.
