Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is what NVIDIA builds today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:19:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is the foundation by which we can enable Europe to be part of the AI ecosystem, the AI economy.
