Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.08,0:26:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,While Vera Rubin is in full production and the performance is off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:08.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single generation, as I mentioned, through extreme co-design,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.74,0:26:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're able to achieve performances that are well beyond reason, well beyond what Moore's law would have would have dictated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.84,0:26:18.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as you know, Moore's law has really largely ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.59,0:26:29.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we need these extreme co-design ideas working from chips to systems, systems to system software, to algorithm, to the entire AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, Vera Rubin is another giant step on top of Blackwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.36,0:26:44.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blackwell was about 30 times faster than Hopper in doing agentic in doing large language model processing.
