Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.57,0:34:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,people install and build data centers and hopefully as a result velocity goes up the wasted idle compute,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.61,0:34:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the wasted idle cap x will reduce and everybody becomes more profitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.52,0:34:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is NVLink 72 now into a large cabinet system we call it DSX pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.00,0:34:18.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.40,0:34:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,so this is the next click of Nvidia computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now what you make and how you make it makes you special.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.60,0:34:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as here in Europe, you, the work you know, makes you special.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.36,0:34:45.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You design machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.40,0:34:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You operate factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.72,0:34:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You discover medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.12,0:34:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have extraordinary craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.24,0:34:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,That craft, that specialty, makes you special.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.28,0:35:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, what makes NVIDIA special are really two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.92,0:35:10.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first thing is that our architecture is the only accelerated computing architecture that is general-purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.24,0:35:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't specialize on just one one algorithm, for example, transformers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.44,0:35:19.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,We specialize across anything that could be paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.46,0:35:21.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could be fluids and particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.53,0:35:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be quantum.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.92,0:35:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be quantum chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.48,0:35:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could be image processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.88,0:35:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could be data processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.29,0:35:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Structured vector data processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.84,0:35:32.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Processing of all kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.38,0:35:40.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because we've been working at it for so long, and because NVIDIA's architecture has remained consistent for literally two and a half decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.86,0:35:49.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,the number of algorithms, the number of domains, the number of industries we serve, we accelerate, has grown tremendously.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.46,0:35:55.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our installed base, our general-purpose architecture, our dedication to this architecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.41,0:36:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and our collaboration with all of the world's industries has made NVIDIA's architecture literally everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.00,0:36:06.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second thing is how we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.46,0:36:16.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, we have the architecture that we developed, but we also build it now in a full stack complete AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.42,0:36:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are many companies in the world who want to design their own chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.68,0:36:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But most of the companies in the world just wants to deploy the AI infrastructure so that they could run their business on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.20,0:36:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ability to design a chip and build a supercomputer, write all the software,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.60,0:36:38.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,is really completely out of mind for most of the companies around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.47,0:36:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we now have the combination of these two ideas, CUDA, full-stack AI factories, and it exposes us to markets that otherwise is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.96,0:36:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're able to partner with so many companies here for this very reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.73,0:37:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I were to go around this, starting with CSPs, this is where most people think the vast majority of AI is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.44,0:37:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, as you can see in the beginning of our keynote, I mentioned a whole bunch of companies who are not those.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, CSPs remain very large businesses for the world's computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.40,0:37:17.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, there are AI natives, companies that are starting all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.47,0:37:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's so many that are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.88,0:37:25.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Neo clouds, because every region wants to participate in the AI economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.50,0:37:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every region wants to ensure that the valuable resources that they have, the energy that they have, is dedicated to companies in their region.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.76,0:37:40.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,For example, Mistral here in in Europe, Mistral in France, Nebia is here in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.25,0:37:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many companies around Europe that are building up neo clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:50.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,OEMs and ODMs who are building computers for the world's enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.16,0:37:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, we know about last last year, all we spoke about was Open AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.53,0:38:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,To- Today, we spoke about we speak about Open AI, Anthropic, but we also talk about the incredible Meta's Muse, Grok, Bot, and of course, Gemini.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.01,0:38:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many different AI labs are now participating at the frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.84,0:38:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then, very importantly, and this is ultimately the most important, for AI to succeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.24,0:38:26.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,for Europe to benefit from AI and to have really created an AI ecosystem and AI economy,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need all of the end markets, the end industries to adopt AI and to succeed with AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.12,0:38:36.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether it's in the automotive industry because we're building self-driving cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.11,0:38:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,or the way you manufacture with robotics, the way you discover new drugs in healthcare,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.36,0:38:52.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,your financial services in inst industry, all of these different industries have to become AI companies, every single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, we have a unique ability through what I just mentioned about CUDA and the way that we build computers,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.01,0:39:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have a unique ability to serve literally every single segment of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.00,0:39:11.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, one architecture, many markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.84,0:39:20.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because these infrastructure are so significant and so expensive, we need to make sure that they're as productive as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.06,0:39:28.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,as soon as possible, that they're fungible, that you can use it for every workload from the beginning of your AI journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.84,0:39:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,data processing to training to post-training, inference and agentic processing, every single step of the AI journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.85,0:39:44.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,to every type of AI, chemicals and physics to languages to every single industry and the algorithms that they use.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.03,0:39:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, NVIDIA's architecture is fungible and as result of that, continuous innovation, continuous updating of software.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:59.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because the installed base is so great, we have such an incredibly rich ecosystem of software,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.21,0:40:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,then these architectures also durable, fungible, durable, productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.16,0:40:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, that lays the foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.60,0:40:10.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is the infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.18,0:40:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what do we do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.48,0:40:15.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,This last year, we saw a transition in AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.42,0:40:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is now productive and it's one of the most important times was in the beginning of the year when we spoke about Open Claw,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.00,0:40:32.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,which introduced the concept of an open-source agent, and it really started what we all see across the world today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.48,0:40:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents think, reason, iterate, use tools, and as a result, consume an enormous amount of tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as a result, they become useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.96,0:40:50.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, more agents are being developed, they're more useful, and they're and therefore they're used by more people,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.98,0:40:57.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,and because they have to use a lot of tokens to think, the amount of token consumption has gone through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.43,0:41:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,GPU demand has really gone through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.12,0:41:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what's processing it is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.32,0:41:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.36,0:41:06.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are the five elements of an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.60,0:41:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first part are the language models.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.96,0:41:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are the tokens that are running on top of the GPUs, and they're generating tokens that are consumed by the agent, what I I call the exoskeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.88,0:41:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That Open Claw harness sits inside a sandbox, and that sandbox isolates it from the rest of the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.36,0:41:30.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a very important concept that we're going to come back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.64,0:41:31.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are five things.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.74,0:41:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's the model, there's the harness, the sandbox that the harness sits in, and two other things, knowledge and tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.92,0:41:46.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Models, sandbox, harness, knowledge, and tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.42,0:41:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are the five elements of an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.97,0:41:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, before I talk about how to make the agents useful, the most important thing is we have to make sure that the agent is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.40,0:41:59.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agent is autonomous.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.98,0:42:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an autonomous system that has access to files, has access to resources, networks, access to tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.00,0:42:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we need to make sure that the privileges that we provide this autonomous system is minimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.88,0:42:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that we constantly monitor it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.04,0:42:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We introduced a fantastic new product, a new platform, and it's called Open Shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.32,0:42:27.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open Shell came just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.39,0:42:32.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a secure runtime that provides for the things that I just mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.64,0:42:36.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And has an additional hardware-based monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.90,0:42:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before I explain it to you, let's watch a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.12,0:42:47.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enterprises are preparing to deploy billions of AI agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.78,0:42:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be useful, they'll reason, plan, use tools, access data, and work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.96,0:42:59.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, the only thing stopping an agent from misusing all that is asking it nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.95,0:43:01.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please don't delete anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.02,0:43:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please don't push to main.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.00,0:43:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please don't touch my SSH keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.64,0:43:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the please don't approach, but hope isn't security.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.24,0:43:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safety isn't an aspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.24,0:43:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's technology and engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.64,0:43:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Open Shell and Sentry put that philosophy into practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.88,0:43:30.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You write a policy for what each agent can touch, and Open Shell enforces it at the granularity of system calls, file access, and network connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.08,0:43:34.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Formal verification checks every policy change against your permission ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.74,0:43:38.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, agents never gain more access than intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.40,0:43:40.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's like the early internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.42,0:43:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Viruses were everywhere until browsers enforced strict limits on what a webpage could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.92,0:43:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open Shell does the same for agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.40,0:43:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enforcement happens outside the agent, not just in LLM guardrails, bringing agent native security into your infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.84,0:44:04.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every agent runs inside its own isolated sandbox with no direct route to the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.20,0:44:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every outbound network request goes through the supervisor outside the sandbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.85,0:44:11.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,It checks the action against your policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.50,0:44:14.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it's not permitted, it's denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.48,0:44:20.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keys stay outside with the supervisor and are added only on the way to an approved endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.19,0:44:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,A compromised agent can't leak a key it never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.84,0:44:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gateway is the control plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.40,0:44:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The supervisor makes the decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.52,0:44:35.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sandbox holds the agent and the policy prover checks proposed policies against your permission ceilings.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.84,0:44:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open Shell combines Linux kernel isolation with runtime policy enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.12,0:44:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Sentry adds an optional layer of protection outside the host itself, away from the agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.32,0:44:57.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Running on Nvidia BlueField 4, Sentry monitors agent activity and enforces security policies in a hardware isolated trust domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.12,0:45:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because agent reasoning traffic passes through Sentry, if the agent is planning to do something unintended,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.92,0:45:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will update policies immediately and cut the connection to the model, quarantining it in milliseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.64,0:45:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it keeps tamper evident records that operators can verify for detection, investigation, and response.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.92,0:45:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open Shell is open source under Apache 2.0, runs everywhere your agents do, edge to cloud, and takes two commands to adopt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.12,0:45:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Install the CLI, create a sandbox, and run your favorite agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.04,0:45:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents are only as useful as the access you give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.24,0:45:37.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open Shell and Sentry put that access under your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.76,0:45:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's how we advance
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.01,0:45:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI capabilities
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.92,0:45:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and safety together.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.68,0:45:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents are autonomous systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.33,0:46:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to create extremely secure technology to make sure that we could develop these agents and deploy these agents safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.60,0:46:04.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, it's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.71,0:46:13.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,After announcing Open Shell, just about every major company in the world, from the frontier labs to the operating system companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.44,0:46:18.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,cybersecurity companies, platform companies have come out to adopt Open Shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.15,0:46:19.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really fantastic to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.84,0:46:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because this technology has arrived at exactly the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.55,0:46:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,At a time when we want to deploy agents all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.48,0:46:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, remember, this isn't just about the services using Open Shell as they deploy agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.73,0:46:38.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is really about all of the world's companies also adopting Open Shell so
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.67,0:46:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you could receive these agents and have them run autonomously inside your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.57,0:46:52.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single level of capability, every single task that you give the agent, for every person that uses the agent,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.66,0:46:59.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,every one of those combinations requires a different level of privilege that you would provide to the agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.60,0:47:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And every single time that an agent is launched, the privileges are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.00,0:47:11.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, privileges, the policy enforcement, the monitoring, all has to be done dynamically.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.63,0:47:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, Open Shell is really revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.55,0:47:21.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm delighted to say that Anthropic and Nvidia are partnering to create Claude Open Shell agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.10,0:47:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, you can go to the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.92,0:47:25.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a really great write-up about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.26,0:47:34.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the first part the first part is how do you use these harnesses, Open Claw, Hermes, Open Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.44,0:47:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could create your own own harnesses from LangChain, Deep Agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.24,0:47:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's or just write it from Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.32,0:47:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch of different ways you could create agent harnesses that sits inside now an Open Shell secure harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.48,0:47:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.89,0:47:55.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's the sandbox that it sits in, the secure sandbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.92,0:48:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then next, let's talk about models.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.12,0:48:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh there you should use uh models of all kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.85,0:48:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the future, it won't just be one model that we run everything on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.76,0:48:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to run We're going to use the best models, whether they're closed, open, or custom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.52,0:48:16.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to use all the models to do your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.34,0:48:24.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, the work that you do is fairly generic, artificial general intelligence is going to do an incredibly good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.63,0:48:30.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, sometimes, the work that you want to do captures too much of your proprietary knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.42,0:48:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,too much of your specialty, and you want to continuously enhance that intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.36,0:48:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company in the future will use both closed models as well as open models you customize.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.33,0:48:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,By the end of the session, you will see that in fact, building your own AIs is not that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.76,0:48:52.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It starts with, of course, the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.76,0:49:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been dedicated to advancing open models for to open up new opportunities and enable people to build their own custom AIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.28,0:49:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,NeMo-Tron is for languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.35,0:49:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos is our world foundation model.
