Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.40,0:51:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, first, Agent Harness running in a secure sandbox open shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.04,0:51:59.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second, Neumotron large language models, the first two components of what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.32,0:52:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But ultimately, what turns these super agents, these agents into super agents, is that you give them access to your company's knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.84,0:52:11.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.42,0:52:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is called the agent knowledge foundation that we put together.
