Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.59,0:52:28.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,It allows you to turn your company's data The data could be in the assets could be in uh unstructured format in documents,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.62,0:52:33.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that you need an AI to understand how to read these PDFs and read all these unstructured documents,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.66,0:52:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,or it could be in structured data inside databases.
