Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.39,0:54:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.84,0:54:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, all of those different uh libraries and data processing capabilities now makes for you your knowledge foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.95,0:54:24.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've now armed your AI with proprietary data, proprietary knowledge.
