Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.64,0:54:35.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA's been working on CUDA-X, and for most of you, in the last before AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.77,0:54:41.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,all of our conversations have been about around how do we accelerate simulators and solvers,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.47,0:54:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,data processing engines, domain-specific libraries of all kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.20,0:54:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're used in scientific discovery, in all the different fields of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.12,0:54:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're used in engineering, they're used in research, they're used in designing, building, creative arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.44,0:55:03.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,At this core, are CUDA-X libraries, and these CUDA-X libraries are algorithms.
