Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.16,0:57:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Math is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.22,0:57:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Math is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.28,0:57:49.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,CUDA X libraries, these are the crown jewels of our company.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.94,0:57:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.96,0:57:57.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you're building an AI assistant, it could be a a lab assistant, it could be a research assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.34,0:58:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,it could be a co-designer, a somebody who's co-creator with you, building something with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.96,0:58:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, what makes those agents useful, what makes them able to do real work, are the tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.96,0:58:22.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we we now have models that allow these agents to reason, understand information,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.56,0:58:28.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,reason, to be able to plan, and iteratively act and use tools until it can get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.66,0:58:30.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it still comes down to the tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.91,0:58:34.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these tools we've been working on for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.47,0:58:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there was one particular computer I showed you on the right-hand side that runs every single one of these tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.00,0:58:42.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it could be fluid dynamics and particle physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.39,0:58:44.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be quantum chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.10,0:58:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be data processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.84,0:58:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be ray tracing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.92,0:58:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of these tools run on that one computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.16,0:59:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that one computer speeds up the processing of it compared to just running it natively on a CPU by 10, 50, 100 x.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.00,0:59:05.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And CUDA CUDA X tools is what give the agents the tools of the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.71,0:59:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's so cool to see
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.97,0:59:18.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,how other people are using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.26,0:59:29.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.50,0:59:37.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.68,0:59:45.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so So this is the magic magic behind the agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.51,0:59:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, the agents have to use tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.00,0:59:55.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, of course, in one of the first fields of agentic use is software programming and therefore a compiler or Python is all really it needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.63,1:00:02.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in the future, as we have these tools do more and more more and more useful work, we're going to need to give them more tools.
