Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.13,1:00:30.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,our world foundation model that understands the physical world, and CUDA-X tools.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.30,1:00:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here's example of Dassault creating a virtual companion that uses Nvidia's NeMo Triton, our language model, and CUDA-X tools.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.10,1:00:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's see them in use.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.84,1:00:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most intelligent scientist still needs a laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.92,1:00:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best engineer still needs simulators and solvers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.80,1:00:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,An AI agent is no different.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.36,1:00:59.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,An agent brings together five building blocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.25,1:01:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The model perceives, reasons, and plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.96,1:01:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The harness coordinates the work.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.80,1:01:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Knowledge foundation gives the agent context from your company's structured and unstructured data.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.32,1:01:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tools let the agent simulate, experiment, and act.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.44,1:01:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Open Shell controls what agents can access and execute.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.68,1:01:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Start with a frontier closed model or customize an open model.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.16,1:01:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,With NVIDIA's agent toolkit, any company can turn its knowledge and expertise into a customized super agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.84,1:01:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's look at three examples.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.20,1:01:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,For Lyra Sciences, the goal is to design a therapy for B-cell lymphoma.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.84,1:01:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Lyra Iris agent, built on NVIDIA NeMo tron, turns that goal into an experimental plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.40,1:01:55.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the computational dry lab, Lyra agents use NVIDIA BioNeMo agent toolkit to call models for protein design and RNA optimization,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.92,1:01:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,running millions of virtual experiments.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.68,1:02:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most promising candidates move into Lyra's AI science factory,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.20,1:02:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,where autonomous robots and instruments, developed with NVIDIA Omniverse and Cosmos, make and test them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.96,1:02:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The results return to Iris, shaping the next designs and experiments.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.68,1:02:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The loop continues.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.16,1:02:22.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,At Siemens electronic factory Erlangen, the goal is to bring new products into production.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.54,1:02:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Process preparation X agents use NVIDIA Cosmos to generate virtual prototypes and synthetic data,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.92,1:02:34.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,then train and validate inspection models before production starts.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.72,1:02:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intelligence center X agents, built with NVIDIA's factory operations blueprint, use orders, supplies, and line setups to recommend production plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.24,1:02:50.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Digital twin composer uses NVIDIA Omniverse libraries to validate those plans with
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.62,1:02:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,physics simulation and real-time factory data before changes reach the factory floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.60,1:03:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Dassault Systèmes platform, an engineer needs to adapt a Volkswagen Golf door design for the Tiguan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.56,1:03:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aura and Leo use NVIDIA NeMo tron to reason over engineering requirements.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.16,1:03:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The harness coordinates the specialized sub-agents and preserves context across planning, design, and simulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.92,1:03:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aura uses Innovia to plan the work around the vehicle's dimensions, weight limits, and other engineering requirements.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.32,1:03:33.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leo design agent selects a compatible golf door design and uses CATIA to reshape it for the Tiguan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.12,1:03:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leo simulation agent uses Simulia accelerated by NVIDIA CUDA X libraries to test the variants, revealing a vibration problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.84,1:03:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The results return to the design agent for refinement.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.24,1:03:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The engineer reviews the refined designs and selects the final one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.32,1:03:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Different goals, different expertise, the same building blocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.52,1:04:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open models, CUDA X accelerated tools, and the open shell secure runtime brought together with the NVIDIA agent toolkit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.68,1:04:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.04,1:04:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, some people said that AI is here is going to be the end of software.
