Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.41,1:04:20.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's exactly the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.63,1:04:27.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is here, there'll be more users of these tools that we created over time than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.78,1:04:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single tools company will now become an AI company.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.28,1:04:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,They'll be an agents company.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.76,1:04:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only will they offer tools, but they'll offer you specially optimized agents that are incredibly good at using their tools.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.88,1:04:48.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keynes and CrowdStrike and Dassault, IQVIA, and just about every enterprise company out there are all building agents,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.46,1:04:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we're just delighted to be working with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.82,1:04:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Building agents is not that hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.52,1:04:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's got four compo- five components.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.68,1:05:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's got the model, the harness, both of them have closed and open versions, the open shell secure runtime,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.33,1:05:08.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then most importantly, the knowledge and tools, and those knowledge and tools belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.80,1:05:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's your expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.76,1:05:15.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, all of this is now possible to do and I'll show you more in just a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.87,1:05:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,But before I do that let's talk about physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.55,1:05:22.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's really the the next wave of AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.79,1:05:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that understands the physical world, can reason about it because the physical world is diverse, it is complicated,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.76,1:05:41.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's got extremely long tails and to reason about it and use a appropriate tools to interact with the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.16,1:05:43.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever people think about physical worlds, they think robotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.99,1:05:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, one of my favorite physical world applications is the radio cell phone cell towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.01,1:05:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.44,1:06:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It uses instead of cameras instead of speakers and microphones, it uses radio waves to sense the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.92,1:06:11.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to it reasons about it, it processes information, reasons about it and interacts with the world using beam forming.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.30,1:06:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So in fact, this is an application, a technology that is just perfectly suited for AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.17,1:06:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI will revolutionize the way we do telecommunications.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.96,1:06:28.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will enhance our spectrum efficiency tremendously, just as we've done so with ray tracing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.03,1:06:32.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of the graphics that you've seen completely 100% ray traced,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.23,1:06:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the amount of computation we thought necessary in the past and now that we apply AI to is a million to one difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.16,1:06:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we're going to bring to the telecommunications network an enormous step up in spectrum efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.68,1:06:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,But beyond that, we're also going to revolutionize all of these cell towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.72,1:06:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's 100,000 sites around the world, around the western world,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.53,1:07:04.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,about 100 gigawatts of distributed data centers that will in the future become a distributed AI infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.31,1:07:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're delighted to partner with many companies here in Europe and just this last week after working on this
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.12,1:07:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,for nearly eight years Nvidia made the first commercial phone call on the on the T-Mobile network with Nokia.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.72,1:07:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so now CUDA makes phone calls the traditional way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.24,1:07:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then once it can do that, then we can layer AI on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.69,1:07:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the revolution is going to begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.97,1:07:32.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is really exciting opportunity for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.27,1:07:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The other physical AI application that I'm super excited about is essentially robotic radiotherapy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.68,1:07:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your two the tumor is changing in shape the physical body is changing while you're in in therapy the robot this radio adaptive
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.12,1:07:56.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,radiotherapy system has to perceive the changing environment understand where the tumor
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.59,1:08:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,is segment it just perfectly and direct precisely direct the radiotherapy accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.74,1:08:09.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Essentially robotic that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.12,1:08:11.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.64,1:08:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a form of robotic surgery.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.80,1:08:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now of course the highest volume the most near-term robotics application or physical AI
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.57,1:08:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,application that everyone recognized has been something we've been working on for over a decade.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.52,1:08:35.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now we recognize that every single car company will want to make their cars part of the ride hailing fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.59,1:08:44.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today we have right right hailing and it's part of Uber and here in in Europe we have uh Bolt and we have Grab and Lyft and
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.34,1:08:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,so on so forth and all these different ride hailing services in the future
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.04,1:08:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,there'll be robo-taxis that will be connected to those ride hailing services as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.92,1:08:56.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it won't be from just one brand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.63,1:09:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we recognize that building these systems are incredibly expensive particularly the software that goes on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.12,1:09:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We decided to create one standard architecture, 14 different cameras, nine radar systems, three lidars,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.64,1:09:27.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,umteen ultrasonics, this cocoon of a shell of sensors powered by dual Nvidia GPU systems for the AV computing system.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.16,1:09:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We turned this into an industry standard, and now it's being designed into one car fleet after another.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.16,1:09:40.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,On top of it, are AV software companies, and we are in in fact one of them as well,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.33,1:09:48.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,to build an autonomous robotaxi capability, which then is connected into the ride-hailing services.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.43,1:09:50.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,This ecosystem is being built out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.38,1:09:54.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world travels about a trillion miles per year around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.23,1:10:01.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of those miles in the future, you know, a dollar or two per mile are going to be on mobile taxis.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.95,1:10:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is one giant opportunity, but it's incredibly fragmented.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.02,1:10:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, creating an industry standard, Hyperion, and working with an entire ecosystem,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.28,1:10:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,we could create essentially a giant virtual fleet that everybody can connect into.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.64,1:10:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, I'm super proud to announce that four more brands, four more cars are going to lines are going to come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.32,1:10:30.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The VW van, I just can't imagine anything more iconic.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.86,1:10:38.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,The JLR brand new car, the Volvo fleet, as well as Mercedes next generation,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.05,1:10:48.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,are going to be also Hyperion compatible and be part of this network, this ride-hailing network robotaxi fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.55,1:10:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, welcome to Hyperion.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.92,1:11:03.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next major industry, the next major industry, the next great industry and this one is likely to be extremely large is human robotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.63,1:11:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a reason why robotics is hard to do because all the different work is rather diverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.84,1:11:17.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so building a special configuration for each one of the diverse tasks segments the
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.59,1:11:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,robotics industry into all of these different configurations which prevents the technology flywheel to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.52,1:11:29.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reason why the cell phone has advanced so quickly, the reason why personal computers have advanced so quickly,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.37,1:11:38.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,the reason why Nvidia's NVLink 72 has advanced so quickly is because of those standardized configurations allows many customers to use it,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.55,1:11:47.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,the volume to therefore be derived, that volume drives the technology flywheel and it gets faster, better, incredibly fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.82,1:11:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we need a robotics uh configuration that is as standard as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.00,1:12:02.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now human robotics obviously has the ability it probably isn't perfect for everything, but it's likely to work for many things.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.91,1:12:08.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a result, this is likely going to be the largest volume robotics configuration.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.66,1:12:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now if we could just create the AI that allows it to learn very quickly,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.37,1:12:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,then for small medium businesses who don't have an entire robotics team to teach and program the robot can now show the robot what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.92,1:12:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The robot because it has general capabilities and general intelligence would be able to learn and adapt quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.80,1:12:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is likely to be the next major platform, technology platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.20,1:12:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working with so many different companies you will recognize many of them here in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.32,1:12:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is your great opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.68,1:12:50.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,No country, no region has dedicated itself to making mechatronics, electronics,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.51,1:12:56.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,mechanical systems at the level of precision and craft as the European region.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.46,1:12:59.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many companies here are incredibly good at manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.99,1:13:03.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the next high volume industry,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.07,1:13:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you could see there's so many companies that are now part of it,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.41,1:13:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we're delighted to to be partnered with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.56,1:13:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, in order to create in order to create a physical AI system, you need three computers.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.28,1:13:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first computer is the one we've been talking about and everybody knows quite well, which is training the AI model.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.12,1:13:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second computer is where we have the AI learn how to do its skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.92,1:13:43.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't just have the AI program the AI and have the AI come out into the physical world and try to do whatever it wants to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.03,1:13:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do it inside a digital twin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.04,1:13:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We create a digital twin called Omniverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.73,1:13:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen us talk about that repeatedly, and in fact,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.97,1:13:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,just now when when you saw all the CUDA-X libraries, they're all being done inside a digital twin world.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.20,1:14:01.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,That digital twin world is called Omniverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.98,1:14:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Omniverse is a library that's connected into all kinds of platforms and tools, Siemens and Dassault and Cadence and so on and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.25,1:14:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you could see these digital twin systems being created.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.64,1:14:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.40,1:14:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third computer is the robotics computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.12,1:14:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That computer integrates, in the case of the self-driving car, the robo-taxi, we call it Hyperion.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.80,1:14:31.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hyperion consists of the computer itself, the functional safety system,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.86,1:14:39.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,the active safety system, a operating an operating system designed for physical AI safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.28,1:14:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What we need to do exactly the same for robotics systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.92,1:14:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that every single time you start to develop research and start to work on your own robotic systems,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.36,1:14:56.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't have to start from scratch to cobble up all of the software and computing systems and the sensors and all the mechanical systems,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.22,1:14:59.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,that alone would take several years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.32,1:15:02.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we decided to build a reference robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.88,1:15:07.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the NVIDIA Agile One in partnership with Agile Robotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.94,1:15:18.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This robot is going This reference robot will be available in the
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.40,1:15:23.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,first quarter of next year and it will come pre-assembled with computer inside,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.18,1:15:29.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,software integrated, and it should be able to perform quite well right out of the bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.32,1:15:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is a great starting point and it will be the flywheel by which we can accelerate development of robotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.00,1:15:41.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, let me start Let me end today's speech from where we started.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.48,1:15:43.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA started in the PC revolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.96,1:15:48.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was in 1993 and the PC revolution was just about to start.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.87,1:15:52.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember Windows 95 kicked it into turbo charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.68,1:15:58.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We came since then, invented the GPU, programmable shading, real-time real-time ray tracing,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.04,1:16:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,we added CUDA to the computing model and helped ignite the modern AI revolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.88,1:16:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so four four years ago, we started to think, what can we do to reimagine the personal computer for this new era?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.88,1:16:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where the personal computer is not just your tool, your personal computer tool, but your personal agent or your personal assistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.60,1:16:29.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the way you interact with this computer would be essentially a companion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.04,1:16:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Somebody who helps you do work.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.44,1:16:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this computer needs to have exactly the five things that I mentioned today.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.36,1:16:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It needs to have model, it could be running locally or it could be running in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.24,1:16:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It needs a harness.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.96,1:16:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It needs a secure runtime, open shell.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.72,1:16:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it needs access because it's available on your PC, it needs access to knowledge and tools.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.76,1:17:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the good news is because NVIDIA has been accelerating tools for so long,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.28,1:17:10.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,if we could just create a computer that can accelerate OpenGL and DirectX and everything CUDA,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.08,1:17:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,everything NVIDIA has ever worked on would run on this computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.12,1:17:15.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.11,1:17:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 4 years of partnership with Microsoft, we have created the RTX Spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.85,1:17:27.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is a brand new line of computers this every literally thousands of years thousands of engineering years went into this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.48,1:17:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been secretly working on it for 4 years, created a chip called the N1X,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.84,1:17:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then we just recently announced it with the entire PC industry joining forces.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.32,1:17:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,We created desktops, laptops, and workstations.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.77,1:17:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is one petaflops.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.08,1:17:54.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,One petaflops, just to put that in perspective, in the year 2016, I delivered one petaflops and 128 GB of memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.91,1:18:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,One petaflops and 128 GB to a small company called OpenAI.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.04,1:18:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is one
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.77,1:18:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,petaflops and 128 GB.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.44,1:18:21.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The The only difference, of course, is that I can hold this like this and DGX-1 took two people to carry upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.86,1:18:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is the brand new RTX Spark PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.52,1:18:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you would like to have a companion workstation that runs CATIA and everything the cell and everything Autodesk and auto you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.89,1:18:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Adobe and Cadence and Synopsys, you can always get yourself a DGX Station that runs Windows.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.00,1:18:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is 20 petaflops and 754 gigabytes of memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.97,1:18:50.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.80,1:18:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, there's also the desktop version.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.24,1:18:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of these are now these are now available and I think the DGX Station with RTX
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.44,1:19:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spark with a DGX Spark DGX Station with Windows will be available at the end of this year.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.02,1:19:11.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the question is so far I just talked about the five components of an agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.44,1:19:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now the question is how do you build it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.72,1:19:21.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you build an agent that runs, let's say, on one of those computers or runs in the cloud or runs on prem somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.72,1:19:25.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, the answer is it's really easy and you do it this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.24,1:19:27.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way you build an agent is you
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.63,1:19:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,ask an agent to build it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.88,1:19:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this this is the prompt that is going to run the next application.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.43,1:19:48.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what's what you're about to see is this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.40,1:19:51.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're about to see a robotics application.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.24,1:19:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And while you're watching this demo, just remember there's an agent running on this personal computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.64,1:20:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This demo runs across three computers.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.24,1:20:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first computer is to train.
