Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.08,1:20:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the third is to put that AI into the computer itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.40,1:20:13.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.86,1:20:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, two very two ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.68,1:20:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first idea is agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.28,1:20:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you build it and run it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.88,1:20:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what you can use it to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.68,1:20:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the second is physical AI computing model which consists of three computers.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.48,1:20:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.20,1:20:43.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Meet Micro Duck, Hugging Face's robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.64,1:20:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's teach it to see and walk with NVIDIA RTX Spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.96,1:20:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I use Hermes as my agent harness, Nemotron and Open AI's GPT-6 Astra as my models,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.32,1:21:02.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,and CUDA-X accelerated tools FreeCAD, Blender, and Isaac Sim, Newton physics engine, and Isaac Lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.99,1:21:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll run everything on my RTX Spark, except when I need to burst larger workloads to cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.20,1:21:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, I describe the course and what my Micro Duck needs to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.00,1:21:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,On RTX Spark, Hermes and Nemotron plan the course, listing every object required.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.72,1:21:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Astra takes it from there, using FreeCAD to model 3D objects,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.36,1:21:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blender to apply materials, and Omniverse SimReady libraries to add physical properties.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.00,1:21:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Isaac Sim, Astra composes the scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.08,1:21:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Astra rigs Micro Duck's joints, actuators, and links,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.68,1:21:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and simulates how Micro Duck moves with Newton physics engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.84,1:22:00.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, training begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.92,1:22:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the cloud, thousands of Micro Ducks train in parallel in Isaac Lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.76,1:22:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every fall, a lesson, improving the policy every time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.64,1:22:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Omniverse libraries simulate Micro Duck's cameras, teaching it to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.32,1:22:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,With perception and physics working together, my Micro Duck can avoid obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.96,1:22:31.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,navigate tight spaces,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.46,1:22:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and adapt to its surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.36,1:22:52.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I download the policy to RTX Spark and use NeMo and Triton and Isaac Sim to evaluate my Micro Duck with multi-robot orchestration.
